</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>All my sins are forgiven!</l><l>All my fetters are riven!</l><l>I enjoy peace of heaven!</l><l>Jesus saves me now!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Neither sin nor temptation,</l><l>Neither Satan’s vexation,</l><l>Nor the world’s best elation</l><l>Can enslave me now!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>I will sing Hallelujah!</l><l>I will sing Hallelujah!</l><l>I will sing Hallelujah!</l><l>Jesus saves me now!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
